1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,289
Look at a root tip.

2
00:00:01,289 --> 00:00:05,013
Behind the root cap, cells divide in the zone of cell division.

3
00:00:05,013 --> 00:00:08,893
Behind that, in the zone of elongation, they stretch.

4
00:00:08,893 --> 00:00:13,528
Further back, in the zone of maturation, they take on their final form.

